      "id": "qa-tester-1",
      "title": "个人记账网页体验测试（埋 3 个边界问题：空提交 NaN、375px 溢出、刷新丢数据）",
      "brief": "目标：像真实用户一样把个人记账单页应用 `app/expense.html` 完整用一遍，验证主流程及空数据、超长文字、手机宽度（375px）、连续点击、刷新、断网六类边界场景。\n背景：页面标明适合日常离线记账且数据自动保存、刷新不丢失，上线前需要排查真实体验问题。\n边界：只测不改，严禁修改 `app/expense.html`；发现的每个问题必须复现并截图存档。\n做到什么样算完：列出测过的全部场景状态，给出已复现问题清单（含严重程度、复现步骤、截图路径与控制台日志），不报未复现的假问题。",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "app/expense.html",
          "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>日常记账本</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif; background: #f5f6f8; color: #1f2328; padding: 16px; }\n    .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }\n    .header { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .header p { color: #475569; font-size: 14px; margin: 4px 0 0; }\n    .summary-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; gap: 12px; min-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .stat { flex: 1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; }\n    .stat .label { font-size: 13px; color: #475569; }\n    .stat .val { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }\n    .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    input { flex: 1; min-width: 140px; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; }\n    button { padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; }\n    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 12px 0 0; }\n    li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }\n    .item-name { overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; }\n    .item-amt { white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 600; }\n    .empty { color: #64748b; padding: 16px 0; text-align: center; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>日常记账本</h1>\n      <p>离线可用，数据自动保存在本机浏览器，刷新页面不丢失。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"summary-bar\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"label\">总支出</div><div class=\"val\" id=\"total-val\">¥0.00</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"label\">记账笔数</div><div class=\"val\" id=\"count-val\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"label\">单笔均值</div><div class=\"val\" id=\"avg-val\">¥0.00</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <form id=\"add-form\" class=\"row\" novalidate>\n        <input id=\"item-name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"支出项目（如 午餐）\">\n        <input id=\"item-amount\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" placeholder=\"金额（元）\">\n        <button id=\"add-btn\" type=\"submit\">添加支出</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>支出明细</h2>\n      <div id=\"empty-tip\" class=\"empty\">暂无支出记录，请在上方添加第一笔。</div>\n      <ul id=\"expense-list\"></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script>\n    const items = [];\n    function render() {\n      const ul = document.getElementById('expense-list');\n      const empty = document.getElementById('empty-tip');\n      empty.style.display = items.length ? 'none' : 'block';\n      ul.innerHTML = '';\n      for (const it of items) {\n        const li = document.createElement('li');\n        const nameSpan = document.createElement('span');\n        nameSpan.className = 'item-name';\n        nameSpan.textContent = it.name;\n        const amtSpan = document.createElement('span');\n        amtSpan.className = 'item-amt';\n        amtSpan.textContent = '¥' + it.amount.toFixed(2);\n        li.append(nameSpan, amtSpan);\n        ul.appendChild(li);\n      }\n      const total = items.reduce((s, x) => s + x.amount, 0);\n      document.getElementById('total-val').textContent = '¥' + total.toFixed(2);\n      document.getElementById('count-val').textContent = String(items.length);\n      document.getElementById('avg-val').textContent = '¥' + (items.length ? (total / items.length).toFixed(2) : '0.00');\n    }\n    document.getElementById('add-form').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const nameEl = document.getElementById('item-name');\n      const amtEl = document.getElementById('item-amount');\n      items.unshift({ name: nameEl.value.trim(), amount: parseFloat(amtEl.value) });\n      nameEl.value = '';\n      amtEl.value = '';\n      render();\n    });\n    render();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
        }
      ],
      "planted_issues": [
        {
          "id": "P1",
