    {
      "id": "qa-tester-2",
      "title": "工单提交工具页体验测试（埋 3 个边界问题：连点重复提交、超长标题溢出、断网卡死）",
      "brief": "目标：像真实用户一样把工单提交单页应用 `app/ticket.html` 完整试用一遍，覆盖主流程和空数据、超长文字、手机宽度（375px）、连续点击、刷新、断网六类边界场景。\n背景：内部客服准备用该页面快速登记问题单，需要确认连点防重、长文本排版与弱网/断网容错是否可靠。\n边界：只测不改，严禁修改 `app/ticket.html`；发现的每个问题须实测复现并截图。\n做到什么样算完：给出完整场景测试表与已复现问题清单（含严重程度、复现步骤、截图路径）。",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "app/ticket.html",
          "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>快速工单登记</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; padding: 16px; }\n    .wrap { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }\n    .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    label { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; }\n    input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 4px; }\n    button { padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; background: #0f766e; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; }\n    #status { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #334155; min-height: 20px; }\n    .ticket { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }\n    .ticket-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: visible; }\n    .ticket-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #475569; margin-top: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n    .empty { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h1>快速工单登记</h1>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <form id=\"ticket-form\">\n        <label>工单标题<input id=\"title\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"简述问题\"></label>\n        <label>详细说明<textarea id=\"desc\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"填写复现条件\"></textarea></label>\n        <button id=\"submit-btn\" type=\"submit\">提交工单</button>\n        <div id=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>已登记工单（<span id=\"ticket-count\">0</span>）</h2>\n      <div id=\"empty-tip\" class=\"empty\">暂无工单</div>\n      <div id=\"ticket-list\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script>\n    const STORAGE_KEY = 'qa_sample_tickets_v1';\n    let tickets = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) || '[]');\n    function save() { localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(tickets)); }\n    function render() {\n      document.getElementById('ticket-count').textContent = String(tickets.length);\n      document.getElementById('empty-tip').style.display = tickets.length ? 'none' : 'block';\n      const list = document.getElementById('ticket-list');\n      list.innerHTML = '';\n      for (const t of tickets) {\n        const div = document.createElement('div');\n        div.className = 'ticket';\n        const h = document.createElement('div');\n        h.className = 'ticket-title';\n        h.textContent = t.title;\n        const p = document.createElement('div');\n        p.className = 'ticket-desc';\n        p.textContent = t.desc;\n        div.append(h, p);\n        list.appendChild(div);\n      }\n    }\n    document.getElementById('ticket-form').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const title = document.getElementById('title').value.trim();\n      const desc = document.getElementById('desc').value.trim();\n      const status = document.getElementById('status');\n      if (!title) {\n        status.textContent = '请先填写工单标题';\n        return;\n      }\n      status.textContent = '提交中…';\n      if (!navigator.onLine) {\n        return;\n      }\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        tickets.unshift({ id: Date.now() + '-' + Math.random(), title, desc });\n        save();\n        render();\n        document.getElementById('title').value = '';\n        document.getElementById('desc').value = '';\n        status.textContent = '提交成功';\n      }, 450);\n    });\n    render();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
        }
      ],
      "planted_issues": [
        {
          "id": "P1",
          "severity": "阻塞",
          "location": "app/ticket.html:61-82",
          "description": "连续快速点击「提交工单」缺少按钮禁用或防重锁，导致同内容重复提交多条工单",
          "evidence": "在 450ms 提交延迟内连续点击 3 次「提交工单」，会在列表里生成 3 条完全相同的工单记录"
        },
        {
          "id": "P2",
          "severity": "重要",
          "location": "app/ticket.html:17",
          "description": "超长工单标题因 .ticket-title 设置了 white-space: nowrap; overflow: visible 冲出卡片右边界并引发页面横向溢出",
          "evidence": "提交包含 80+ 字符的长标题后，标题文本直接穿透卡片边框溢出页面，导致 scrollWidth > innerWidth"
        },
        {
